  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>属性值加成</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>体型</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>速度</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>选择一项：</p><p>(a)选择一项属性+2;选择一项不同的属性+1 (b)选择三项不同的属性+1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>小型/中等</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30尺</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><h3>生物类型 Creature Type。</h3><p> 你是泥怪。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">体型 Size。</strong> 你的体型为中型或小型。当你选择该种族的时候决定体型。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">速度 Speed。</strong> 你的步行速度为 30 尺。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">无定型体 Amorphous。</strong>只要你没有携带或穿着任何东西，你就能跻身通过至多只有1寸宽的空间。你为发起或逃脱擒抱所进行的属性检定具有优势。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">黑暗视觉 Darkvision。</strong>在微光光照下，你身边 60 尺内可以视为等同于明亮光照。而在黑暗中，该范围内可视为等同于微光光照。你无法在黑暗中分辨颜色，只能看到有灰度的黑白画面。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">屏息 Hold Breath。</strong> 你能屏住呼吸达1个小时。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">天生坚韧 Natural Resilience。</strong> 你具有强酸和毒素伤害的抗性，你为防止陷入中毒状态所做的豁免具有优势。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">变化自身 Shape Self。</strong> 使用一个动作，你可以重塑你的身体，让你拥有一个头、1~2只手臂、1~2条腿，以及临时的手和脚，你也可以变回没有肢体的浆团。当你具有人类般的身形时，你能穿着和你体型相同的类人生物的衣服和护甲。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">以一个附赠动作，你能挤出一条伪肢（或是将已有的伪肢收回你的体内），这条伪肢至多 6 寸宽，10 尺长。作为该附赠动作的一部分，你能用这条伪肢操纵一个物件，打开或关闭一扇门或容器，或是捡起或放下一个微型物件。这条伪肢不具有感知器官，不能用来攻击、激活魔法物品，或是举起超过 10 磅重的物体。</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\"><p><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">语言 Languages</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">你的角色能够说、读和写通用语和另一种你和 DM 认为适合该角色的语言。《玩家手册》提供了一项可供选择的泛用语言列表。DM 能自由地为特定战役从列表中去掉或增加语言。</p></div><p>(注：该种族的名称取自“等离子团Plasmoid ”一词)<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">流浆体是无定型体生物，没有固定形状。当在其他生物的面前时，他们往往会变成与这些生物相似的形状，但流浆体几乎不可能会被错认为其他种族。它们通过渗透作用摄取食（像阿米巴原虫那样），并通过微小的孔隙排泄废物。它们通过另一组气孔吸收氧气来呼吸，它们的四肢强壮而灵活，足以抓取和操纵武器及工具。虽然大部分的流浆体都是半透明的灰色，但是它们能通过孔洞吸收染色剂来改变颜色和透明度。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">流浆体没有通常意义上的内部器官。它们的身体由细胞、纤维、等离子软泥和神经簇组成。这些神经使流浆体能够探测到光、热、质地、声音、疼痛和振动。流浆体可以使它们身体的外层变硬，以保持类似人类般的形状，因此它们可以穿戴衣服和饰品。它们通过压迫空气从管腔中流出，并通过这种收缩来产生声音。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">当流浆体睡觉时，它们会失去刚性并散开，因此有时流浆体会被误认为是一块岩石，或环境中的其他景观。</p><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Choose one of: (a) Choose any +2; choose any other +1 (b) Choose three different +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Small/Medium</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Creature Type.</span> You are an Ooze.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Size.</span> You are Medium or Small. You choose the size when you select this race.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Amorphous\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Amorphous.</span> You can squeeze through a space as narrow as 1 inch wide, provided you are wearing and carrying nothing. You have advantage on ability checks you make to initiate or escape a grapple.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Darkvision\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Darkvision.</span> You can see in dim light within 60 feet of yourself as if it were bright light, and in darkness as if it were dim light. You discern colors in that darkness only as shades of gray.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Hold Breath\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Hold Breath.</span> You can hold your breath for 1 hour.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Natural Resilience\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Natural Resilience.</span> You have resistance to acid and poison damage, and you have advantage on saving throws against being &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned].</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Shape Self\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Shape Self.</span> As an action, you can reshape your body to give yourself a head, one or two arms, one or two legs, and makeshift hands and feet, or you can revert to a limbless blob. While you have a humanlike shape, you can wear clothing and armor made for a Humanoid of your size.</p><p>As a bonus action, you can extrude a pseudopod that is up to 6 inches wide and 10 feet long or reabsorb it into your body. As part of the same bonus action, you can use this pseudopod to manipulate an object, open or close a door or container, or pick up or set down a Tiny object. The pseudopod contains no sensory organs and can't attack, activate magic items, or lift more than 10 pounds.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and one other language that you and your DM agree is appropriate for your character.</p></div><p>Plasmoids are amorphous beings with no typical shape. In the presence of other folk, they often adopt a similar shape, but there's little chance of mistaking a plasmoid for anything else. They consume food by osmosis, the way an amoeba does, and excrete waste through tiny pores. They breathe by absorbing oxygen through another set of pores, and their limbs are strong and flexible enough to grasp and manipulate weapons and tools. Although most plasmoids are translucent gray, they can alter their color and translucence by absorbing dyes through their pores.</p><p>Plasmoids don't have internal organs of the usual sort. Their bodies are composed of cells, fibers, plasma-like ooze, and clusters of nerves. These nerves enable a plasmoid to detect light, heat, texture, sound, pain, and vibrations. Plasmoids can stiffen the outer layers of their bodies to maintain a humanlike shape, so they can wear clothing and accessories. They speak by forcing air out of tubular cavities that constrict to produce sound.</p><p>When plasmoids sleep, they lose their rigidity and spread out and are thus sometimes mistaken for a rock or some other feature of the environment.</p>",
